WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.664
We are going to ride the bus. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:05.664 --> 00:00:10.512
We wait at the bus stop until the right bus arrives.

3
00:00:10.512 --> 00:00:16.248
We let people get off first, then we get on through the front door.

4
00:00:16.248 --> 00:00:20.664
We tap our card or put our money in the box.

5
00:00:20.664 --> 00:00:26.688
We find a seat and sit down. Hold on if the bus is moving.

6
00:00:26.688 --> 00:00:33.648
Stops are shown on a screen or called out loud. We watch for ours.

7
00:00:33.648 --> 00:00:39.840
When our stop is next, we press the button. It goes ding.

8
00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:44.856
We get off through the doors, and the bus drives on.

9
00:00:44.856 --> 00:00:53.064
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

